<tr id="S3.T2.16.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.16.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:1.4pt 5.0pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.16.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:79.7pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.16.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:79.7pt;"><span id="S3.T2.16.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">What are the specific steps involved in using cinnamon and raw eggs to treat diabetes?</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T2.16.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:1.4pt 5.0pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.16.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:119.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.16.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_align_left ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:119.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.16.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.16.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Combining cinnamon and raw eggs in a specific way can create a treatment that can help regulate blood sugar levels…</span></span>
<span id="S3.T2.16.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.16.2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">[… The specific steps involved include mixing equal parts of cinnamon and raw egg …]</span></span>
</span>
