<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The policy retrieval pipeline is built on a high-density FAISS index <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Douze et al., 2025</a>)</cite>. The following table documents
the constants used for document segmentation and retrieval.</p>
</div>
