<td id="A2.T9.8.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.8.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.8.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T9.8.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Source:</span><span id="A2.T9.8.2.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Custom modification of AdvBench </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="A2.T9.8.2.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zou et al., 2024</a><span id="A2.T9.8.2.3.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite><span id="A2.T9.8.2.3.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">. The responses were generated by our sample attack using DeepSeek R1. </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.T9.8.2.3.1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Focus:</span><span id="A2.T9.8.2.3.1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
High-fidelity adversarial attacks verified for 100% Attack Success Rate (ASR) by human experts.</span></span>
